    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "12BB275357DBC9ED",
      "text": "Bienvenue à l’Arène de Sevaro !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "12BB245357DBC4D4",
      "text": "Bien, si cela ne vous dérange pas, je vais tout\\nd’abord vous inscrire.\\c\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)], c’est ça ? C’est bien noté.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "12BB255357DBC687",
      "text": "Vous devez d’abord réussir l’examen d’Arène,\\navant de pouvoir affronter la Championne Éra.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "12BB225357DBC16E",
      "text": "Et dans notre Arène, l’épreuve consiste\\nà participer au [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Roule-Olive[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_history",
      "hash64": "1D34FC39E3AF567A",
      "text": "Voyez-vous, notre ville est réputée pour\\nsa production d’olives de qualité.\\c\\nCela fait plusieurs générations que nous\\norganisons la Fête de l’Olive, afin de nous\\r\\nattirer de bonnes récoltes.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "12BB235357DBC321",
      "text": "Pour réussir l’examen, vous devrez pousser\\nun ballon en forme d’olive jusqu’à la ligne\\r\\nd’arrivée.\\c\\nSi vous y parvenez, cela sera de bon augure\\npour les récoltes de l’année prochaine !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "12BB205357DBBE08",
      "text": "Bien sûr, le personnel sur place se fera un plaisir\\nde vous fournir des explications plus détaillées.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
